{"ref":"BDB, בָּנָה","hw":"בָּנָה","html":"<big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנָה</span></big></big><sub>373</sub><big></big>  <strong>vb. build (</strong>MI, Nab. Eut<sup> No. 1</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">בנה</span>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">בן</span>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَنَا</span> Assyrian <em>banû</em> COT<sup>Gloss.</sup> cf. Ba<sup>ZMG 1887, 640</sup>, Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">בני</span> CIS <sup>iv. 1, No. 56</sup>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܢܳܐ</span> Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">בנא</span> Vog<sup>No. 31</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.5\">Dt 20:5</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽנְתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.1\">Pr 9:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.1\">14:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִיתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.10\">Dt 6:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.3\">1 K 9:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבָנִ֫יתָ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.20\">Dt 20:20</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִיתְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.25\">Ez 16:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.13\">1 K 8:13</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:5\" href=\"/Genesis.11.5\">Gn 11:5</a> +, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְנֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.9\">Dt 25:9</a> +; juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיִבֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:3\" href=\"/Ezra.1.3\">Ezr 1:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּבְנֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:50\" href=\"/Joshua.19.50\">Jos 19:50</a> + 2 times <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּ֫בֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:22\" href=\"/Genesis.2.22\">Gn 2:22</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְנֵ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:19\" href=\"/Job.20.19\">Jb 20:19</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּ֫בֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.24\">1 Ch 7:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.3\">Zc 9:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְנֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.27\">2 S 7:27</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.22\">Is 65:22</a> +, etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:1\" href=\"/Numbers.23.1\">Nu 23:1</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:24\" href=\"/Numbers.32.24\">Nu 32:24</a> +; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.13\">1 K 8:13</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.17\">1 Ch 6:17</a> +, etc.; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּנֶה (בּוֹנֶה)</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:17\" href=\"/Genesis.4.17\">Gn 4:17</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּנֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:2\" href=\"/Psalms.147.2\">ψ 147:2</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹנִים (בֹּנִים)</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:1\" href=\"/Ezra.4.1\">Ezr 4:1</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:32\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.32\">1 K 5:32</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, etc.; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.4\">Ct 4:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:28\" href=\"/Judges.6.28\">Ju 6:28</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנוּיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 122:3\" href=\"/Psalms.122.3\">ψ 122:3</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנוּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.4\">Ne 7:4</a>;—<em>build</em>, <strong>1.</strong>  (lit.) <strong>a.</strong>  c. acc. (α) of city (Hex only JE) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:17\" href=\"/Genesis.4.17\">Gn 4:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:11\" href=\"/Genesis.10.11\">10:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:4\" href=\"/Genesis.11.4\">11:4</a>, <a data-